/blob-report/

# Blender sources for the 4Runner asset (~89 MB combined). Untracked from HEAD deliberately —
# they are authoring inputs that no build step, test, or deploy reads; the only consumer of that
# geometry is public/models/modsnation_7416_assets_assembled.glb, which is committed.
#
# They remain in git history and are retrievable by blob SHA — FINAL_ASSET_MANIFEST.md has the
# exact commands. Ignored rather than merely untracked so a stray `git add -A` from whoever has
# them on disk cannot put 89 MB back into the object database.
/assets/blender/modsnation_7416_assets_assembled_final.blend
/assets/blender/modsnation_7416_assets_assembled_final.glb
